{"id":"6b353e786100a314","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-polynomial-numeration.md","title":"关系在固定理论中的多项式数码表示","display":"df-polynomial-numeration — 关系在固定理论中的多项式数码表示","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-polynomial-numeration","aliases":["72-df-polynomial-numeration"],"display":"df-polynomial-numeration — 关系在固定理论中的多项式数码表示","depends_on":["[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]]","[[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII Definition6.1.3, print578/PDF590","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source quantifiers, short numeral substitution and size parameters checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"补齐已引用上游的精确显示签名"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-polynomial-numeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-polynomial-numeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polynomial-numeration — 关系在固定理论中的多项式数码表示"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a8a8a9d3352a4c4f\" href=\"?note=a8a8a9d3352a4c4f\" title=\"72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral\">72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" href=\"?note=c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" title=\"72-df-finite-sequence-proof\">72-df-finite-sequence-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII Definition6.1.3, print578/PDF590"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source quantifiers, short numeral substitution and size parameters checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"补齐已引用上游的精确显示签名"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>k∈ω，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\\)</span> 分量互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\)</span> 且自由变量包含于 ran(\\vec x)。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>bn、λ 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a8a8a9d3352a4c4f\" href=\"?note=a8a8a9d3352a4c4f\" title=\"72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral\">72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral</a>；ProofObject、FOL⁼ 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" href=\"?note=c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" title=\"72-df-finite-sequence-proof\">72-df-finite-sequence-proof</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是作为输入指定的单射函数，满足下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PolySize}_{\\mathrm A}(\\operatorname{enc})\">\\(\\operatorname{PolySize}_{\\mathrm A}(\\operatorname{enc})\\)</span>；大小为该函数值的串长。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span> 为非负整数系数多项式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\)</span>。NumInst 采用逐个闭数码代入。</li>\n<li>实际调用的五元谓词为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,A,\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,A,\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 为有限公式序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_t,\\ell_f\">\\(\\ell_t,\\ell_f\\)</span> 沿基本项、公式的有限树递归；联结词宏先按上游展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_{\\rm seq}\">\\(\\ell_{\\rm seq}\\)</span> 为显式列表大小，变量指标采用二进制位长。编码与列表大小的双向多项式界是本定义的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\ell_t(v_i)&amp;:=1+\\lambda(i+1),\\qquad \\ell_t(0):=1,\\qquad \\ell_t(St):=1+\\ell_t(t),\\\\\n\\ell_t(t+u)&amp;:=\\ell_t(t\\cdot u):=1+\\ell_t(t)+\\ell_t(u),\\\\\n\\ell_f(t\\doteq u)&amp;:=\\ell_f(t\\le u):=1+\\ell_t(t)+\\ell_t(u),\\\\\n\\ell_f(\\neg A)&amp;:=1+\\ell_f(A),\\qquad \\ell_f(A\\lor B):=1+\\ell_f(A)+\\ell_f(B),\\\\\n\\ell_f(\\forall v_iA)&amp;:=1+\\ell_t(v_i)+\\ell_f(A),\\\\\n\\ell_{\\rm seq}(\\pi)&amp;:=1+\\sum_{j&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(\\pi)}(1+\\ell_f(\\pi_j)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PolySize}_{\\mathrm A}(\\operatorname{enc})&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c,d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})^{&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\left[\\ell_{\\rm seq}(\\pi)\\le c(|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|+1)^d\n\\land|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|\\le c(\\ell_{\\rm seq}(\\pi)+1)^d\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\ell_t(v_i)&amp;:=1+\\lambda(i+1),\\qquad \\ell_t(0):=1,\\qquad \\ell_t(St):=1+\\ell_t(t),\\\\\n\\ell_t(t+u)&amp;:=\\ell_t(t\\cdot u):=1+\\ell_t(t)+\\ell_t(u),\\\\\n\\ell_f(t\\doteq u)&amp;:=\\ell_f(t\\le u):=1+\\ell_t(t)+\\ell_t(u),\\\\\n\\ell_f(\\neg A)&amp;:=1+\\ell_f(A),\\qquad \\ell_f(A\\lor B):=1+\\ell_f(A)+\\ell_f(B),\\\\\n\\ell_f(\\forall v_iA)&amp;:=1+\\ell_t(v_i)+\\ell_f(A),\\\\\n\\ell_{\\rm seq}(\\pi)&amp;:=1+\\sum_{j&lt;\\operatorname{dom}(\\pi)}(1+\\ell_f(\\pi_j)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PolySize}_{\\mathrm A}(\\operatorname{enc})&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists c,d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ \\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})^{&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\left[\\ell_{\\rm seq}(\\pi)\\le c(|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|+1)^d\n\\land|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|\\le c(\\ell_{\\rm seq}(\\pi)+1)^d\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_0:=\\rho,\\quad\\rho_{i+1}:=\\rho_i[\\operatorname{bn}(n_i)/x_i]\\quad(i&lt;k),\\quad\n\\operatorname{NumInst}(\\rho,\\vec x,\\vec n):=\\rho_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_0:=\\rho,\\quad\\rho_{i+1}:=\\rho_i[\\operatorname{bn}(n_i)/x_i]\\quad(i&lt;k),\\quad\n\\operatorname{NumInst}(\\rho,\\vec x,\\vec n):=\\rho_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PN}_{T,\\operatorname{enc}}(\\rho,R;\\vec x)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\ \\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\ \\Bigl[\\vec n\\in R\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\operatorname{NumInst}(\\rho,\\vec x,\\vec n),\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\\\\n&amp;\\land|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|\\le p(1+\\sum_{i&lt;k}\\lambda(n_i))\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PN}_{T,\\operatorname{enc}}(\\rho,R;\\vec x)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\ \\forall\\vec n\\in\\omega^k\\ \\Bigl[\\vec n\\in R\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\operatorname{NumInst}(\\rho,\\vec x,\\vec n),\\operatorname{FOL}^{=}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\\\\n&amp;\\land|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|\\le p(1+\\sum_{i&lt;k}\\lambda(n_i))\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书的“双向等价于存在短证明”，不只是 R 的真元组有某个无界长度证明。对固定 k，以输入总位长的一元多项式为界与多元位长多项式约定等价。理论、公理呈现、编码及公式的变量表都是参数；不自动保证任意公式、任意理论的这种表示存在。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"a8a8a9d3352a4c4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-binary-arithmetic-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-sequence-proof","status":"resolved","id":"c42b7f1faaf95a1c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading"